# Typed into go.img's console with the data disk on a USB stick (make
# usb-smoke, W27-S04): the stick is read, pulled out through QEMU's monitor
# (device_del), read again, which fails, and the kernel goes on running
# programs.
wait burrow>
type disks
key ret
type cat /mnt/hello.txt
key ret
wait Hello from the FAT32
monitor device_del stickdev
sleep 2
type ls /mnt/docs
key ret
type run /bin/hello
key ret
wait hello from ring
type poweroff
key ret
